Description: CUBE high performance write library (intel, OpenHPC)
 CubeW is the writing library component of the CUBE performance report
 explorer, providing a C API for writing CUBE4 performance data.
 Built with the intel compiler family.
 .
 This package is part of the OpenHPC project.
